Package: lightraw
Version: 1.0.0
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Moestret <moestret.nawawie@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libssl3 | libssl1.1, libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxrandr2, libxi6, libgl1
Homepage: https://github.com/moestret/LightRaw
Description: Professional 32-bit Linear RAW Photo Editor & Catalog
 LightRaw is a native, ultra-fast, non-destructive RAW photo editor and
 image asset manager. Featuring a full 11-stage Camera RAW develop pipeline,
 instant 120 FPS canvas pan/zoom, SQLite catalog management, and batch export.
